================================================================================
DETECTION 1: RDP BRUTE FORCE DETECTION (MITRE T1110)
================================================================================
Description: Identifies potential RDP brute force attempts via Event ID 4625.
Threshold: Recommended to alert if count > 5 within a 5-minute window.

index=main EventCode=4625

| eval Attacker_IP = coalesce(SourceNetworkAddress, IpAddress, Source_Network_Address)
| stats count as "Failed Logins" by Attacker_IP
| sort -"Failed Logins"


================================================================================
DETECTION 2: SUSPICIOUS POWERSHELL EXECUTION (MITRE T1059.001)
================================================================================
Description: Catches hidden process execution or download cradles via Sysmon ID 1.

index=main EventCode=1 (_raw="*Bypass*" OR _raw="*Hidden*" OR _raw="*Invoke-WebRequest*")

| stats count as "Suspicious Events" by ComputerName, _raw
| rename ComputerName as "Victim PC", _raw as "Command/Details"
